@startuml
actor "Student" as Student
participant "Student App" as StudentApp
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "User & Enrollment Service" as UserSvc
database "DB" as DB

== Xem thông tin ==
Student -> StudentApp : open app
StudentApp -> API : GET /me, /enrollments
ref over Student, StudentApp, API, Auth
    UC-16 Authorization Flow
end ref
API -> UserSvc : fetch profile/enrollments
UserSvc -> DB : select user/enrollment
DB --> UserSvc : data
UserSvc --> API : data
API --> StudentApp : render form

== Đăng ký & Cập nhật dịch vụ ==
Student -> StudentApp : submit profile/enrollment
StudentApp -> API : PUT /enrollments {address,schedule,status}
ref over Student, StudentApp, API, Auth
    UC-16 Authorization Flow
end ref
API -> UserSvc : validate & update
UserSvc -> DB : upsert enrollment
DB --> UserSvc : ok
UserSvc --> API : updated
API --> StudentApp : response
@enduml